{
  "_PROVENANCE": "Species-mechanism test: does REAL environment carry occupancy mechanism beyond a geographic range prior? Same real USGS BioData and same seed=42 spatial hash holdout as species_health_leakagefree. Each survey site's coordinates were resolved to an NHDPlusV2 COMID via the EPA WATERS PointIndexing service, then REAL StreamCat catchment+watershed landscape metrics (NLCD land cover, PRISM climate, STATSGO soils, terrain, hydrology, anthropogenic stressors) were downloaded per COMID. Per-species counts are NEVER used as input (leakage-free). ENV-ONLY feature sets exclude lat/lon/HUC so no species range prior can cheat. GBM probe + logistic cross-check, matching species_health_honest.json. Bootstrap 95% CIs on the WIDESPREAD Unionid mussel (the one honest bioindicator; a range prior cannot cheat it).",
